/* Guided symptom-specific troubleshooting */
"Mac 当前状态" = "Current Mac Status";
"Mac 的键盘服务尚未就绪。可以手动重建一次；如果仍失败，请导出诊断报告。" = "The Mac keyboard service is not ready. You can manually rebuild it once. If it still fails, export diagnostics.";
"上一步" = "Back";
"下一步" = "Next";
"保持 Mac 蓝牙设置打开。在手机进入“设置 → 蓝牙”；若未看到 Mac，退出该页面后重新进入。确实看到这台 Mac 后点“下一步”；仍找不到则点“已完成，仍不行”。" = "Keep Mac Bluetooth settings open. On your iPhone, open Settings → Bluetooth. If the Mac is missing, leave that page and return. Click Next when you actually see this Mac; otherwise choose Done, Still Not Working.";
"停止重复尝试，保存诊断" = "Stop Repeating Steps and Save Diagnostics";
"先完成 Mac 的准备" = "Prepare the Mac First";
"先打开 Mac 配对入口" = "Open Pairing on the Mac First";
"先打开并保持 Mac 蓝牙设置。你也可以手动在 iPhone 的“设置 → 蓝牙”中关闭蓝牙约 10 秒再开启，等待约 20 秒后重试；这会短暂断开手机的其他蓝牙配件，请自行决定是否执行。完成后点“下一步”重试，仍失败则导出诊断。" = "First open Mac Bluetooth settings and leave them open. You can also manually turn Bluetooth off for about 10 seconds in iPhone Settings → Bluetooth, turn it back on, and wait about 20 seconds before retrying. This briefly disconnects the phone’s other Bluetooth accessories; choose whether to do it. Click Next to retry, or export diagnostics if it still fails.";
"先检查 Mac，再选择手机上遇到的情况。每一步由你确认结果，最后以手机实际显示文字为准。" = "Check the Mac, then choose what you see on your iPhone. You confirm each step’s result; success requires seeing text on the phone.";
"先点下方按钮。在 Mac 系统窗口选择自己的 iPhone；保持该窗口打开，必要时在手机“设置 → 蓝牙”中点这台 Mac，并核对两端配对码。请先读完这些操作再打开窗口。" = "Click the button below first. In the Mac system window, select your own iPhone and keep the window open. If needed, tap this Mac in iPhone Settings → Bluetooth and compare the pairing codes. Read these steps before opening the window.";
"在手机列表中找到 Mac" = "Find the Mac on Your iPhone";
"在手机点这台 Mac，并按两端系统提示核对配对码。手机显示“已连接”后，仍需等待本 App 收到加密键盘订阅；收到后会自动进入文字测试。" = "Tap this Mac on your iPhone and follow the pairing prompts on both devices. Even if the phone says Connected, wait for this app’s encrypted keyboard subscription. The guide will then advance to a text test.";
"在此 Mac 窗口选择自己的 iPhone，并保持窗口打开。必要时在 iPhone 的“设置 → 蓝牙”中点这台 Mac，核对两端相同的配对码后确认。取消不会清除已有配对。" = "Select your own iPhone in this Mac window and keep it open. If needed, tap this Mac in iPhone Settings → Bluetooth, compare the codes on both devices, and confirm only if they match. Cancelling leaves existing pairings intact.";
