"手机提示配对失败" = "iPhone Says Pairing Failed";
"打开 Mac 蓝牙设置继续检查…" = "Open Mac Bluetooth Settings to Check…";
"打开 Mac 配对入口…" = "Open Pairing on Mac…";
"按步骤继续" = "Follow the Steps";
"服务恢复与诊断" = "Service Recovery and Diagnostics";
"服务恢复已请求。请在手机点这台 Mac 重新连接；新的加密键盘通道就绪后，会自动进入文字测试。仍连不上时，点“已完成，仍不行”继续系统与手机检查。" = "Service recovery was requested. Tap this Mac on your iPhone to reconnect. A new encrypted keyboard channel will advance the guide to a text test. If it still will not connect, choose Done, Still Not Working to check the system and phone.";
"本次手机文字已由你确认" = "You Confirmed This Phone Text Test";
"本轮建议步骤已完成，仍未确认恢复。请保存诊断报告，保留当前配对记录，便于根据证据继续处理。App 不会自动忘记设备或重置系统蓝牙。" = "This attempt’s suggested steps are complete, but recovery is unconfirmed. Save diagnostics and keep current pairing records so the evidence can guide further work. The app will not automatically forget devices or reset system Bluetooth.";
"本轮排查尚未完成新的手机文字测试，请发送后再确认。" = "A new phone text test has not finished for this troubleshooting attempt. Send it before confirming the result.";
"本轮检查完成。关闭此窗口后，可用菜单栏图标或 ⌃⌥K 切换输入；再次按快捷键、按 Esc 或切到其他 Mac 程序会停止输入。" = "This check is complete. Close the window and use the menu bar icon or ⌃⌥K to toggle input. Press the shortcut again, press Esc, or switch to another Mac app to stop.";
"检查系统与手机蓝牙页面" = "Check System and iPhone Bluetooth";
"正在准备本 App 的键盘服务，请稍候。页面会更新状态，不需要反复点击恢复。" = "Preparing this app’s keyboard service. Please wait for the status to update; repeated recovery clicks are not needed.";
"此操作只重建本 App 的键盘服务，会暂时断开手机键盘通道。本轮最多做一次，然后按新的连接结果继续，不要反复重建。" = "This rebuilds only this app’s keyboard service and briefly disconnects the phone keyboard channel. This attempt offers it once, then continues from the new result.";
"用本次新测试确认手机文字" = "Verify Phone Text with a New Test";
"确认手机文字" = "Check Phone Text";
"第一次连接 iPhone" = "First iPhone Connection";
"等待恢复后的新连接" = "Wait for a New Connection after Recovery";
"等待手机建立键盘通道" = "Wait for the Phone Keyboard Channel";
"结束并导出诊断…" = "End and Export Diagnostics…";
"请先启动键盘服务；系统询问蓝牙权限时，选择允许。" = "Start the keyboard service first. Allow Bluetooth access if the system asks.";
"请在 Mac 的“系统设置 → 蓝牙”中开启蓝牙，然后回到这里。" = "Turn Bluetooth on in Mac System Settings → Bluetooth, then return here.";
"请在 Mac 的“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 蓝牙”中允许手机键盘，然后回到这里。" = "Allow MacPhoneKeys in Mac System Settings → Privacy & Security → Bluetooth, then return here.";
"请等待 %ld 秒后，再手动重建服务。" = "Wait %ld seconds before manually rebuilding the service again.";
"请选择第一次连接，或手机上实际看到的问题。App 不能直接读取手机蓝牙页面。" = "Choose first connection or the problem actually shown on your iPhone. This app cannot directly read the phone’s Bluetooth page.";
"连接检查与修复" = "Connection Check and Repair";
"连接通道已经就绪。请按下方说明准备空白备忘录，发送一次测试，再亲眼确认手机显示。已有连接或以前的测试成功，不能代替本次结果。" = "The input channel is ready. Prepare a blank note as described below, send one test, and check the phone yourself. An existing connection or earlier test cannot establish this result.";
"选择当前情况" = "Choose the Current Situation";

/* 0.6.3 system pairing recovery */
"先启动系统蓝牙助理，再在手机点这台 Mac。助理可能不显示独立窗口。" = "Start the system Bluetooth assistant, then tap this Mac on your iPhone. The assistant may not show a separate window.";
"先点“启动系统蓝牙助理”，再在 iPhone 的“设置 → 蓝牙”中点这台 Mac，并核对两端配对码。助理可能没有独立窗口；无法启动时，可使用下方备用入口。" = "Click Start System Bluetooth Assistant, then select this Mac in iPhone Settings → Bluetooth and compare the pairing codes on both devices. The assistant may have no separate window. If it cannot start, use the fallback below.";
"准备 Mac 接收配对请求" = "Prepare the Mac for pairing";
"启动系统蓝牙助理…" = "Start System Bluetooth Assistant…";
"在手机进入“设置 → 蓝牙”；若未看到 Mac，退出该页面后重新进入。确实看到这台 Mac 后点“下一步”；仍找不到则点“已尝试，仍不行”。" = "Open Settings → Bluetooth on your iPhone. If the Mac is missing, leave that page and return. Once you see this Mac, click Next. Otherwise, click Tried, Still Not Working.";
"备用配对窗口…" = "Fallback Pairing Window…";
"备用面板已返回；这不代表键盘已连接。请在手机点这台 Mac，等待下方连接状态更新。" = "The fallback panel has returned. This does not confirm a keyboard connection. Select this Mac on your iPhone and wait for the connection status below to update.";
"如需重新配对，先点下方按钮准备 Mac，再在手机点这台 Mac，并核对两端配对码。手机显示“已连接”后，本 App 仍会等待键盘通道就绪，再自动进入文字测试。" = "If pairing is needed, first click the button below to prepare the Mac. Then select this Mac on your iPhone and compare the pairing codes. Even after the phone says Connected, this app waits for the keyboard channel before proceeding to the text test.";
"尚未收到系统助理的启动结果。请查看系统提示，或使用备用配对窗口；不会自动重复启动。" = "The system assistant has not confirmed its launch. Check for a system prompt or use the fallback pairing window. The app will not launch it repeatedly.";
"已尝试，仍不行" = "Tried, Still Not Working";
"已收到系统蓝牙助理的启动确认。请在手机点这台 Mac，并核对两端配对码；启动成功不代表配对成功。" = "The system Bluetooth assistant confirmed its launch. Select this Mac on your iPhone and compare the pairing codes. Launch confirmation does not mean pairing succeeded.";
"当前无法使用系统蓝牙助理。请使用下方备用配对窗口或 Mac 蓝牙设置继续。" = "The system Bluetooth assistant is unavailable. Continue with the fallback pairing window or Mac Bluetooth settings below.";
"排查已停止。导出报告会区分已请求的操作、跳过的步骤和结束原因；到达此页不代表全部步骤已执行，也不代表连接已恢复。请保留当前配对记录。" = "Troubleshooting has stopped. The report distinguishes requested actions, skipped steps and the reason for stopping. Reaching this page does not mean every step was performed or the connection recovered. Keep your current pairing records.";
"无法执行这一步" = "Cannot Perform This Step";
"服务恢复已请求。请在手机点这台 Mac 重新连接；新的加密键盘通道就绪后，会自动进入文字测试。仍连不上时，点“已尝试，仍不行”继续系统与手机检查。" = "Service recovery was requested. Select this Mac on your iPhone to reconnect. A new encrypted keyboard channel will advance to the text test. If it still fails, click Tried, Still Not Working to continue the system and phone checks.";
"正在请求启动系统蓝牙助理，请稍候。" = "Requesting the system Bluetooth assistant. Please wait.";
"界面预览，不启动系统助理，也不连接手机。" = "Interface preview. The system assistant is not launched and no phone is connected.";
"系统未能启动蓝牙助理。可使用下方备用配对窗口，或导出诊断报告。" = "The system could not launch the Bluetooth assistant. Use the fallback pairing window below or export diagnostics.";
"系统蓝牙助理启动状态：%@；不代表手机已连接。" = "System Bluetooth assistant launch state: %@; this does not confirm a phone connection.";
"若看到两个同名 Mac，先保留记录并验证手机输入；不要仅为消除重复显示而忽略设备。" = "If two Macs have the same name, keep both records and verify phone input first. Do not forget a device just to remove a duplicate entry.";
"请打开配对窗口，选择自己的 iPhone，并按两端系统提示操作；窗口返回成功仍不代表键盘已经连接。" = "Open the pairing window, select your own iPhone and follow the prompts on both devices. A successful window result still does not confirm a keyboard connection.";
"备用窗口：" = "Fallback window: ";
